00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:49.430
to this during the talk.

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:52.470
We have App Engine standard,
which is a sandbox environment.

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:55.499
We have App Engine Flex,
which is based on containers.

00:02:55.499 --> 00:02:57.290
If you've used GCP
